    "text": "Ewangelium de uirginibus.\nSimile est regnum celorum decem uirginibus que accipientes lampades suas exierunt obuiam sponso et\nMatheus se godspellere awrat \u00feis halige bispel alswa ure hlaford crist hit s\u00e6de to his apostlas \u00feus\nSo\u00f0lice \u00fea fife w\u00e6ren dysige and \u00fea fife w\u00e6ren wise.\n\u00d0a namen \u00fea fife dysige heore lihtf\u00e6tes ac hi n\u00e6fdon nan ele mid heom, witodlice fife wise namen ele\n\u00d0a gewear\u00f0 hit swi\u00f0e lange \u00fe\u00e6t se brydgume ne com and \u00fea m\u00e6dene ongunne alle to sl\u00e6panne for\u00f0 to\n\u00dea wur\u00f0on hi ealle awehte for\u00feon \u00fee hi geherdon hlude cleopian and seo st\u00e6mne \u00fee hi geherdon w\u00e6s\n\u00d0a arisan \u00fea m\u00e6dena and on\u00e6ldan heora lihtfates.\n\u00d0a cw\u00e6don \u00fea dysige m\u00e6dena to \u00fean rihtwise, geofa\u00f0 us of eower ele for\u00fean ure leohtfates synde\nHeom andwyrden \u00fea snotere and cw\u00e6\u00f0on, we nabba\u00f0 na mare \u00feonne us selfum behofa\u00f0 ac ga\u00f0 to \u00fean\nSo\u00f0lice \u00fea\u00fea hi foren heom ele to bycgenne \u00fea com se brydgume and genam \u00fea fif snotere m\u00e6dena mid\n\u00d0a \u00e6fter\u00fean comen \u00fea o\u00f0re fif m\u00e6dena and cleopoden to \u00fean brydgume \u00feus cwe\u00f0ende, hlaford hlaford,\nSe brydgume heom andwyrde, nelle ic hit eow geopenian for\u00feon \u00fee ge synde me ungecnawe.\nWacia\u00f0 eornestlice for\u00feon \u00fee ge nyten \u00feone d\u00e6g ne \u00fea tide hw\u00e6nne ic wille eow cleopian.\nSe halga papa Gregorius trohtnode \u00feis godspel and \u00feus w\u00e6s cwe\u00feende mid bli\u00f0e mode to \u00fean\nMine leofa gebro\u00f0ra, ic mynige eow \u00fe\u00e6t ge yfele d\u00e6de befleon and middaneardes fyl\u00f0es forhogian and\nWe geherdon nu hu se almihtiga god s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t hefonerice w\u00e6re gelic teon m\u00e6dene \u00fee eoden mid heora\n\u00d0a w\u00e6re \u00fea fife wise and \u00fea o\u00f0re fife dysige for\u00fean \u00fee hi forhogoden to habbanne ele mid heom ealswa\nEale hw\u00e6t m\u00e6nde ure hlaford crist mid \u00feeossere sp\u00e6ce buton \u00fe\u00e6t ure geleafa is gecleopod her on\nBe \u00fean is so\u00f0lice gewriten \u00fe\u00e6t drihte sceal s\u00e6ndan his \u00e6nglas to syndrienne \u00fea yfele fram \u00fean gode.\nEadige beo\u00f0 \u00fea \u00fee heom selfen fram middaneardes lustas wi\u00f0healda\u00f0 and heora lichama tintregia\u00f0 and\nWito\u00f0lice \u00fea \u00fee \u00feus rihtlice libba\u00f0 heora lif hi sceolon faran on domesd\u00e6ge in to heofonarice mid \u00fean\nNu synda fela o\u00f0ra \u00fee heora lichamen gesw\u00e6nce\u00f0 mid f\u00e6sten and mid w\u00e6ccen and cystiglice geofa\u00f0\nAc hi wilnia\u00f0 for \u00feas \u00feing lof and wuldor to h\u00e6benne \u00e6t mannen and for\u00fean hi syndon gelic \u00fean dysige\nSo\u00f0lice \u00fea wise m\u00e6dena namen ele mid heom on heora lihtfaten.\n\u00deurh \u00fe\u00e6t ele is betacnod ures wuldres brihtnesse and \u00fea lihtf\u00e6tes synde ure heortan on \u00fea we bera\u00f0 alle\n\u00d0a gewar\u00f0 hit swi\u00f0e lange \u00fe\u00e6t se brydguma ne com and \u00fea m\u00e6dena ongunnon alle to sl\u00e6penne.\nHw\u00e6t betacna\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t sl\u00e6p buton se rihtwise deme \u00feonne he cum\u00f0 on domesd\u00e6ge mancyn to demenne?\n\u00deonne sl\u00e6p\u00f0 \u00e6g\u00feer ge gode ge yfele \u00feurh dea\u00fees sl\u00e6pe.\nWito\u00f0lice on middere nihte wear\u00f0 st\u00e6mne geherd \u00feus cleopigende, efne nu cum\u00f0 se brydgume fara\u00f0 ut\nHer ge magon so\u00f0lice understanden hu se eadige papa Gregorius s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t domesd\u00e6g cym\u00f0 \u00e6t \u00feises\n\u00d0a arisan alle \u00fea m\u00e6dena and gearodan heora lihtfaten and eodon ongean \u00feone brydgume.\nEale hw\u00e6t betacne\u00f0 se \u00e6riste buton \u00fe\u00e6t alle men sculon arisen of dea\u00f0es sl\u00e6pe on \u00fean utemestan\nSo\u00f0lice \u00fea rihtwise bera\u00f0 for\u00f0 heora weorc mid heom \u00e6tforen drihtene and mid \u00fean weorce hi hopia\u00f0\nEac \u00fea fif dysige m\u00e6dene \u00fee forhogoden to h\u00e6bbene ele on heora lihtfaten getacnia\u00f0 \u00fea men \u00fee we \u00e6r\nEale \u00feeostre sceolon hi wur\u00f0on ge\u00feuhte \u00e6tforen \u00fe\u00e6s hehstan demes tocume and hi \u00fe\u00e6rfore nane mede\n\u00d0a stunte m\u00e6dene b\u00e6den \u00fea snotere \u00fe\u00e6t hi scoldon heom geofen of heora ele for\u00feon \u00fee heora lihtf\u00e6tes\nWito\u00f0lice on domesd\u00e6ge \u00feonne hi geseo\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t hi nabbe\u00f0 n\u00e6nne d\u00e6l on heofonarice \u00feonne cleopia\u00f0 hi\nBere\u00f0 us nu so\u00f0lice gewitnesse and secga\u00f0 hwilce \u00feincg ge gesegen us wyrcen.\nHeom andwyrda\u00f0 \u00fea fif rihtwise m\u00e6dena and \u00feus cwe\u00f0a\u00f0 to heom, ge wita\u00f0 nu \u00fe\u00e6t hit nis na\nHu mugon we eow beran gewitnesse \u00feonne we mugen unea\u00f0e us selfe beren gewitnesse of godum\nHi cw\u00e6\u00f0on eft to \u00fean stunte m\u00e6dena, ga\u00f0 to \u00fean \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t ele sella\u00f0 and bycge\u00f0 eow \u00fe\u00e6t ge genoh\nSo\u00f0lice \u00fea \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t ele sella\u00f0 beo\u00f0 getacnod swicole men on \u00feissere worulde \u00fea \u00fee wilnia\u00f0 o\u00f0re manna\nHi speca\u00f0 wi\u00f0 heom mid idle herunge swilc hi heom mid ele smeria\u00f0.\nWito\u00f0lice \u00fea\u00fea hi foren heom ele to bycgene \u00fea com se brydgume.\nHw\u00e6t tacna\u00f0 se brydgume buton se rihtwise deme \u00feonne he cum\u00f0 on domesd\u00e6ge mancyn to demenne\nAc drihten cym\u00f0 and ber\u00f0 so\u00f0e gewitnesse manna heorta and naht \u00fe\u00e6re synfulle manna weorc.\n\u00dea fife rihtwise m\u00e6dene ferdan mid \u00fean brydguma in to his brydbure and \u00fe\u00e6t duru wear\u00f0 belocen.\nEale hu egeslic hit is to understandenne \u00fe\u00e6t se brydgume com and hu swetlic hit is to geherene \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea\nWito\u00f0lice drihten bedr\u00e6of\u00f0 alle gesceafte mid his tocume and heofona and eor\u00f0a beofia\u00f0 \u00e6tforen his\nGe\u00fe\u00e6nce\u00f0, leofa bro\u00f0ra, ge\u00fe\u00e6nca\u00f0 hu mycel ege hit beo\u00f0 on \u00fean d\u00e6ge \u00e6tforen drihtenes anseone and\nSe witiga s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t se d\u00e6g is wanung d\u00e6g and geomerung d\u00e6g and eorre d\u00e6g and reownesse d\u00e6g and\nSo\u00f0lice on \u00fean d\u00e6ge bi\u00f0 d\u00e6dbote ac hit ne help\u00f0 naht \u00fean synfullum for\u00feon \u00fee hi forgemden heora\nEala hu biterlice hi sceolon wepan \u00feonne hi geseo\u00f0 hu \u00fea gecorenan m\u00e6n blissia\u00f0 on drihtenes\n\u00d0onne wur\u00fee\u00f0 heofonerices gate belocen \u00e6tforan \u00fean synfullan \u00fee nu d\u00e6ghwamlice st\u00e6nt open\nWito\u00f0lice \u00e6t laste comon \u00fea fif dysige m\u00e6dena and \u00feus w\u00e6ren cwe\u00f0ende, hlaford, hlaford, geopena\nSe brydgume heom andwyrde and cw\u00e6\u00f0, so\u00f0 ic eow secge, ne gecnawe ic eow.\nEale hw\u00e6t muge we nu secgan ymbe \u00feas earm\u00f0e \u00fee we her gehera\u00f0 buton \u00fe\u00e6t se almihtiga god nyle\nHe cleopode and hi noldon him geheran.\nHe anhof up his hand and hi nolden hine geseon ac gew\u00e6ndan heora ryg toweard him and nolden hine\nDrihten cw\u00e6\u00f0 to his leorningcnihtum, wacia\u00f0 eornestlice for\u00fean \u00fee ge nyten \u00feone time ne \u00feone d\u00e6g\nHw\u00e6t betacne\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6cce buton ure d\u00e6dbote \u00fee crist us h\u00e6f\u00f0 geset on \u00feissere worulde ure sawle\nGod underfange\u00f0 mildheortlice ure d\u00e6dbote gif we him eadmodlice to geseca\u00f0.\nEadige beo\u00f0 \u00fea men \u00fee drihten fint wacigende \u00feonne he heom up cleopo\u00f0 on \u00fean mycelan d\u00e6ge.\nEale hwilce synde \u00fea buton \u00fea \u00fee f\u00e6ire\u00f0 heora rihte geleafe mid gode weorcan and drifa\u00f0 fram heom",
